"bg":"","choice":[]},"55":{"step":[[55,56,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306501.png","audio":"610017213","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["可是，我也很努力地去运用它了。我不断地阅读，反复地练习，用训练的方式分析信息……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"56":{"step":[[56,57,""]],"type":6,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306501.png","audio":"610017214","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["但我做不出选择。万一我选择的是错的呢？万一这里就没有正确答案呢？如果我当初没有告诉卡卡尼亚……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"57":{"step":[[57,58,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015980","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——停，你又步入幽微了。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"58":{"step":[[58,59,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015981","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["理性并不神秘，它很多时候只是一种思维的工具。带我们走出幽微，重回事情的本质。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"59":{"step":[[59,60,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306501.png","audio":"610017215","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["本质……？","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"60":{"step":[[60,61,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015982","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["我们为何会在此执行任务，其实是一件非常简单的事，马库斯。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"61":{"step":[[61,62,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015983","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["神秘学家接连不断地倒向重塑，是因为他们许诺“拯救”，而我们不能。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"62":{"step":[[62,63,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015984","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["因此最重要的是破译重塑免疫“暴雨”的术式。倘若我们做不到，仅凭一小块孤立的土地，早晚会在这场时间灾害中走向灭亡。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"63":{"step":[[63,64,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015985","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["总部派出的调查员并非只有我们。我们只需要尽可能地追查、搜集重塑留下的神秘学痕迹，并将它传回科算中心。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"64":{"step":[[64,65,""]],"type":1,"name":["霍夫曼","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"512101.png","audio":"610015986","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["除此之外，一切都是次要的。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"65":{"step":[[65,66,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306501.png","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"66":{"step":[[66,88,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["马库斯紧紧抿着嘴唇，不再言语。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"67":{"step":[[67,68,""]],"type":1,"name":["","","","","","","",""],"head_icon":"","audio":"","bool_1":false,"show_name":false,"show_name_en":false,"no_l2d":false,"text":["——只是专心致志地思考着现有的状况。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"68":{"step":[[68,69,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306501.png","audio":"610017217","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["……霍夫曼女士，除了卡卡尼亚，我们也许还有另一个突破口。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"69":{"step":[[69,70,""]],"type":1,"name":["马库斯","","Marcus","","","","",""],"head_icon":"306501.png","audio":"610017218","bool_1":false,"show_name":true,"show_name_en":true,"no_l2d":false,"text":["那幅画，西奥菲尔的遗作，《拯救》。它有问题。","","","","","","",""],"bg":"","choice":[]},"70":{"step":[[70,71,""]